%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as agent-plane
  participant P1 as PostgreSQL
  participant P2 as Host files
  participant P3 as Firecracker
  P0->>P3: pause, capture memory + devices
  P3->>P2: artifacts
  Note over P0,P3: agent-plane crashes before publishing
  Note over P0,P3: agent-plane restarts
  P0->>P1: read unfinished
  P1->>P0: s1 unpublished
  P0->>P2: inspect staging
  P2->>P0: incomplete set
  P0->>P1: s1 failed
  Note over P0: s1 can never be restored
  P0->>P3: inspect paused machine
  P3->>P0: process alive, paused
  Note over P0: ownership and cleanup stay recorded
